{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18811","headline":"洛中早春赠乐天 · 刘禹锡","name":"洛中早春赠乐天","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"漠漠复霭霭，半晴将半阴。\n春来自何处，无迹日以深。\n韶嫩冰後木，轻盈烟际林。\n藤生欲有托，柳弱不自任。\n花意已含蓄，鸟言尚沈吟。\n期君当此时，与我恣追寻。\n翻愁烂熳後，春暮却伤心。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18811.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18811","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}